  <steps>
    <step order="1" name="Context check">Check context usage; if &gt; 70% create a handoff and stop.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Load knowledge">Read spec FR-13/FR-21, CLAUDE.md empirical findings, ADR-045/019/021/028, and the three absorbed R3 POMLs listed in knowledge.</step>
    <step order="3" name="SummarizeFilesDialog — locate">Read `SummarizeFilesDialog.tsx` in full; grep `fetch.*communications/send` to relocate the inline send (~line 436). Catalog its handler, request-body construction, and success/error side effects.</step>
    <step order="4" name="SummarizeFilesDialog — migrate">Mount `&lt;SendEmailStep /&gt;` (inline) with `composerRef`, `initialBody` = generated summary, appropriate `attachmentSources`, and wizard context. Wizard Finish → `composerRef.current.send()`. Move side effects into `onSent`/`onError`. Delete the inline fetch + dead imports.</step>
    <step order="5" name="FilePreviewDialog — migrate">Locate the LegalWorkspace `FilePreviewDialog.tsx` (grep under `src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/`). Replace its send path with `&lt;SendEmailDialog /&gt;`; wire `onSent`/`onError` (typed `SendCommunicationError`); preserve preview rendering.</step>
    <step order="6" name="DocumentEmailWizard — fix bug">Grep to relocate the attachment mapping (~line 494). Trace `wizardContext.uploadedFiles` to confirm items carry both `documentId` and `driveItemId`. Replace with `attachmentDriveItemIds: currentAttach ? currentKept.map(d =&gt; d.driveItemId) : undefined`. Remove every `attachmentDocumentIds` reference in the file.</step>
    <step order="7" name="Verify removal">Grep each file: `fetch.*communications/send` returns zero in SummarizeFilesDialog + FilePreviewDialog; `attachmentDocumentIds` returns zero in DocumentEmailWizard.</step>
    <step order="8" name="Build + lint">Run `npm run build:prod` and `npm run lint` in `src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/`; rebuild LegalWorkspace for FilePreviewDialog. Fix any failures.</step>
    <step order="9" name="Unit tests">Run shared-lib unit tests; update assertions that targeted removed internals or the old `attachmentDocumentIds` payload.</step>
    <step order="9.5" name="FULL quality gates">Invoke `code-review` on the diff; invoke `adr-check` against spec.md (verify ADR-045/019/021/028 compliance). Address Critical findings.</step>
    <step order="10" name="Update tracking">Mark task 060 ✅ in `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md`; confirm task 062 dependency satisfied.</step>
    <step order="11" name="Reset state">Update `current-task.md`: status → completed; advance to next pending task; record decisions.</step>
  </steps>

